            "pinyin": "Zǎoshang wǒ chī jīdàn hé miànbāo, zhōngwǔ chī mǐfàn hé cài. Wǎnshang bàba zuò fàn, māma hé wǒ yìqǐ chī.",
            "english": "I eat eggs and bread in the morning, rice and dishes at noon. In the evening Dad cooks, and Mom and I eat together."
          }
        ],
        "questions": [
